        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Winfield,_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pastime Theater, built in 1937, now serves as a renovated performing arts center.",
